# Escape Tunnel's first ability: tap and sacrifice it to search for a basic land, which enters tapped.

[Bot1 Deck]
Escape Tunnel
Island x6
Forest
Island x11

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Escape Tunnel.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Escape Tunnel.Activate(Ability: Search your library)
Bot1.Search(Forest)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Tapped = true
Bot1.Graveyard = Escape Tunnel
